=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Rigobertine} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (at (J-8) outside **Order of Weatherspoon.**)
** {p:Waypoint} {z:Eastern Adoulin} Castle Adoulin gates.
* Approach {n:Oscairn}, outside the {p:Peacekeepers' Coalition}, for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Yorcia Weald} via **Bivouac #1** (and head south) or #2 (and head north).
* Examine the **{p:Ergon Locus ???|Ergon Locus}**, in the grove of **Numbing Blossoms** south part of (I-8) (come from (H-8) for getting access) for a cutscene with {m:Ingrid} and {p:Morimar|Morimar (NM)}.
** Make sure to not come from (I-7), and should not be confused with the regular {p:Ergon Locus}.
** Previously, the patch could be blocked by a bush, except between 21:00 and 03:00 in game time. This bush appears to have been removed in the August 2025 version update. __(verification needed)__
